senses.gloss:
वेस् 1. वेस्, cl. 1. P. वेसति, वेसितुम्, to go,
move; to desire, love, (Naigh. II. 6;
another reading has वेशति.)

वेष्टक, अस्, आ, अम्, surrounding, encompassing;
a surrounder; anything which encompasses or en-
closes or invests; (अम्), n. a turban; a wrapper;
exudation, resin, gum, &c.; turpentine; (अस्), m. an
enclosure, wall, fence; a pumpkin-gourd.
